          "content": "Explain mechanisms without conflating genotype, molecular state and observable phenotype; formulate explicit conditional probabilities; solve distinct numerical examples with appropriate denominators; evaluate experimental controls; challenge an alternative interpretation; and inspect the assumptions behind each interactive model.",
